{"overview":"نام هونگ جو که توانایی پیش‌بینی رویدادها را دارد، همراه مادر بیوه‌اش که رستوران کوچکی اداره می‌کند زندگی می‌کند. با وجود این هدیه، اغلب نمی‌تواند نتایج را تغییر دهد. در طرف دیگر خیابان، جونگ جِی چان، دادستان تازه‌کار، و برادر کوچکترش سئونگ وون به همسایگان جدیدشان تبدیل می‌شوند. رویای عجیبی که شامل هونگ جو، وکیل بی‌رحم لی یو بوم و مداخله نجات‌بخش زندگی است، باعث می‌شود جِی چان دریابد سرنوشت آن‌ها به هم گره خورده؛ آن‌ها شروع به به‌اشتراک‌گذاری رویاها و ارتباطات مرموز می‌کنند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Nam Hong Ju, endowed with the ability to foresee events, resides with her widowed mother who runs a small restaurant. Despite her gift, she often finds herself powerless to change the outcomes. On the other side of the street, Jung Jae Chan, a rookie prosecutor, and his younger brother Seung Won become their new neighbors. An unusual dream involving Hong Ju, ruthless attorney Lee Yu Beom, and a life-saving intervention leads Jae Chan to realize their destinies are intertwined, as they begin sharing dreams and connecting in mysterious ways.","tagline_en":"That future, that time, that fate, can it be changed?","runtime":30,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":1,"y":2017,"poster":"/cqq7s0H7LE4t4gOn3C1qEmfJMGf.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":32,"y":2017,"poster":"/92IaChHqSjITbtI2eSkhfBRqn94.jpg"}],"episodes":32,"crew":["오충환"],"crew_en":["Oh Choong-hwan"],"countries":["KR"],"cast":[{"name":"수지","role":"Nam Hong-joo","photo":"/xdmQeM0UuwVGyZucc3eLhynlb7b.jpg","en":"Suzy"},{"name":"لی جونگ سوک","role":"Jeong Jae-chan","photo":"/eW73DbmKQrqb6xDC52oMbVehw6G.jpg","en":"Lee Jong-suk"},{"name":"جونگ هه این","role":"Han Woo-tak","photo":"/7ZMUHR2q0XTWMxuqijWSVfWQv14.jpg","en":"Jung Hae-in"},{"name":"이상엽","role":"Lee Yoo-beom","photo":"/cLjZGSFDNoPexMj5R1oSSSkgClt.jpg","en":"Lee Sang-yeob"},{"name":"Hwang Young-hee","role":"Yoon Moon-seon","photo":"/t6qR3LFv17ZsvlHPZUoODwtwxKa.jpg"},{"name":"신재하","role":"Jeong Seung-won","photo":"/dPCaPnaL0GrqRvHn